        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Converge on standardized SOPs and risk/compliance approach.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi `91858`, as part of `T3`, I have drafted the first couple of SOPs based on the process mapping. They are in the `A2` SOPs Pack for review.",
            "mentions": [
              91858
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T3",
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "Thanks for getting these started. I'm reviewing them now.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "Okay, I've left some detailed comments in the documents within `A2`. The content is a good starting point, but I noticed they have different structures. We need to enforce a single, standardized template for all SOPs to ensure consistency.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M22",
            "text": "I propose a mandatory template with these sections: 1. Purpose, 2. Scope, 3. Responsibilities, 4. Procedure (step-by-step), 5. Associated Documents, 6. Compliance References. This will also make the compliance review for `T8` much more straightforward.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "Oh, okay. A standard template is a good idea. I can reformat the drafts to match that.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M24",
            "text": "Perfect. Let's also define the approval workflow. I suggest: Draft (QE) -> Peer Review (another QE/Site Lead) -> Final Review & Approval (PM & Compliance Officer). This ensures both operational and regulatory checks are done.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M26",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M25",
            "text": "That workflow sounds good to me.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M27",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "Great. Let's lock that in then. We have now agreed on the final SOP template and approval workflow for all sites.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D3"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "👍",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M28",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M27",
            "text": "Now, let's talk about the risk assessment for `T8`. I've set up the `A6` Risk and Compliance Register. We need a consistent way to prioritize risks.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8",
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M29",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M28",
            "text": "I propose we use a standard 3x3 matrix: Impact (High, Medium, Low) vs. Likelihood (High, Medium, Low). Any risk landing in the High/High or High/Medium buckets will require a mandatory mitigation plan before rollout.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M30",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M29",
            "text": "Okay. How do we define what 'High Impact' is?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M31",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M30",
            "text": "Good question. Let's define it clearly. 'High Impact' = potential for regulatory non-compliance, significant operational disruption (>4 hours), or a direct impact on customer product quality. We'll add these definitions to the first tab of `A6`.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M32",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M31",
            "text": "Understood. That makes it much clearer.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M33",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M32",
            "text": "So, are we in agreement on using this Impact/Likelihood matrix with the specified definitions as our risk prioritization criteria?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D4"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M34",
            "speaker_id": 436982,
            "reply_to": "M33",
            "text": "Yes, I agree.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M35",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M34",
            "text": "Excellent. Decision `D4` is confirmed. Please proceed with updating the SOPs in `A2` using the new template and start populating the `A6` register as you draft them.",
            "mentions": [
              436982
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D4"
            ],
