          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M70",
            "speaker_id": 91858,
            "reply_to": "M69",
            "text": "1. At least 95% of impacted staff at Site B complete the training before pilot start.\n2. No P1/P2 operational incidents related to the new QMS during the one-week pilot.\n3. Fewer than 5 'major' issues logged in the `A7` Pilot Rollout Feedback Log.",
            "mentions": [],
